{"title":"Cinnabar","sourceTitle":"Cinnabar/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Cinnabar\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Cinnabar (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cinnabar/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Cinabre (8% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cinnabar/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"Киноварь (8% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Cinnabar/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--low\" title=\"朱砂 (8% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;float:right;\">\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Cinábrio</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-cinnabar.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Ore-cinnabar.png/100px-Ore-cinnabar.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9d/Ore-cinnabar.png/150px-Ore-cinnabar.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9d/Ore-cinnabar.png/200px-Ore-cinnabar.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b><span class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">Cinábrio moído</span></b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Crushed-cinnabar.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/c/cd/Crushed-cinnabar.png/100px-Crushed-cinnabar.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/c/cd/Crushed-cinnabar.png/150px-Crushed-cinnabar.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/c/cd/Crushed-cinnabar.png/200px-Crushed-cinnabar.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table><br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p><b>Cinnabar</b> é um pigmento que pode ser criado a partir do minério de cinábrio. É usado para <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">morrendo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span> e para escrever em placas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Criação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Criação</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Ores\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ores</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Uso\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uso</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Pigment\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pigment</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Dye\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dye</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Selling\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Selling</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Notes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<p><span id=\"Obtaining\"></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ores\">Ores</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O minério de cinábrio pode ser encontrado como pedaços ou blocos superficiais em andesito, granito, ardósia, basalto, peridotito e filito. Também pode ser encontrado quebrando <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Locust\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Locust\">ninhos de locustas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Locust\" title=\"Locust\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"width: 530px; text-align: center;\">\n<caption><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cinnabar in host rock</span>\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Rock</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Normal block</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Ore block</span>\n</th>\n<th><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Cinnabar bits</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Andesite</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/100px-Rock-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/150px-Rock-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/ba/Rock-andesite.png/200px-Rock-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-cinnabar-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/81/Ore-cinnabar-andesite.png/100px-Ore-cinnabar-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/81/Ore-cinnabar-andesite.png/150px-Ore-cinnabar-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/81/Ore-cinnabar-andesite.png/200px-Ore-cinnabar-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-cinnabar-andesite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a5/Looseores-cinnabar-andesite.png/100px-Looseores-cinnabar-andesite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a5/Looseores-cinnabar-andesite.png/150px-Looseores-cinnabar-andesite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a5/Looseores-cinnabar-andesite.png/200px-Looseores-cinnabar-andesite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Basalt</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/100px-Rock-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/150px-Rock-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/bb/Rock-basalt.png/200px-Rock-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-cinnabar-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/09/Ore-cinnabar-basalt.png/100px-Ore-cinnabar-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/09/Ore-cinnabar-basalt.png/150px-Ore-cinnabar-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/09/Ore-cinnabar-basalt.png/200px-Ore-cinnabar-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-cinnabar-basalt.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/0d/Looseores-cinnabar-basalt.png/100px-Looseores-cinnabar-basalt.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/0d/Looseores-cinnabar-basalt.png/150px-Looseores-cinnabar-basalt.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/0d/Looseores-cinnabar-basalt.png/200px-Looseores-cinnabar-basalt.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Granite</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/100px-Rock-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/150px-Rock-granite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/8/89/Rock-granite.png/200px-Rock-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-cinnabar-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a3/Ore-cinnabar-granite.png/100px-Ore-cinnabar-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a3/Ore-cinnabar-granite.png/150px-Ore-cinnabar-granite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a3/Ore-cinnabar-granite.png/200px-Ore-cinnabar-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-cinnabar-granite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/92/Looseores-cinnabar-granite.png/100px-Looseores-cinnabar-granite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/92/Looseores-cinnabar-granite.png/150px-Looseores-cinnabar-granite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/92/Looseores-cinnabar-granite.png/200px-Looseores-cinnabar-granite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Peridotite</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/100px-Rock-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/150px-Rock-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/3d/Rock-peridotite.png/200px-Rock-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-cinnabar-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Ore-cinnabar-peridotite.png/100px-Ore-cinnabar-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Ore-cinnabar-peridotite.png/150px-Ore-cinnabar-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2b/Ore-cinnabar-peridotite.png/200px-Ore-cinnabar-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-cinnabar-peridotite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Looseores-cinnabar-peridotite.png/100px-Looseores-cinnabar-peridotite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f9/Looseores-cinnabar-peridotite.png/150px-Looseores-cinnabar-peridotite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f9/Looseores-cinnabar-peridotite.png/200px-Looseores-cinnabar-peridotite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Phyllite</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-phyllite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/4/45/Rock-phyllite.png/100px-Rock-phyllite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/4/45/Rock-phyllite.png/150px-Rock-phyllite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/4/45/Rock-phyllite.png/200px-Rock-phyllite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-cinnabar-phyllite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/a7/Ore-cinnabar-phyllite.png/100px-Ore-cinnabar-phyllite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/a7/Ore-cinnabar-phyllite.png/150px-Ore-cinnabar-phyllite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/a7/Ore-cinnabar-phyllite.png/200px-Ore-cinnabar-phyllite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-cinnabar-phyllite.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/bd/Looseores-cinnabar-phyllite.png/100px-Looseores-cinnabar-phyllite.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/bd/Looseores-cinnabar-phyllite.png/150px-Looseores-cinnabar-phyllite.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/bd/Looseores-cinnabar-phyllite.png/200px-Looseores-cinnabar-phyllite.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Slate</span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Rock-slate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/6e/Rock-slate.png/100px-Rock-slate.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/6e/Rock-slate.png/150px-Rock-slate.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/6e/Rock-slate.png/200px-Rock-slate.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-cinnabar-slate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/a/ab/Ore-cinnabar-slate.png/100px-Ore-cinnabar-slate.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/a/ab/Ore-cinnabar-slate.png/150px-Ore-cinnabar-slate.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/a/ab/Ore-cinnabar-slate.png/200px-Ore-cinnabar-slate.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Looseores-cinnabar-slate.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/27/Looseores-cinnabar-slate.png/100px-Looseores-cinnabar-slate.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/27/Looseores-cinnabar-slate.png/150px-Looseores-cinnabar-slate.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/27/Looseores-cinnabar-slate.png/200px-Looseores-cinnabar-slate.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>A tier 3 <a href=\"/Pickaxe/pt-br\" title=\"Pickaxe/pt-br\">pickaxe</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pickaxe/pt-br\" title=\"Pickaxe/pt-br\"> </a></span> (<a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\">bronze</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bronze/pt-br\" title=\"Bronze/pt-br\"> </a></span> or higher) or an <a href=\"/Ore_blasting_bomb/pt-br\" title=\"Ore blasting bomb/pt-br\">ore blasting bomb</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_blasting_bomb/pt-br\" title=\"Ore blasting bomb/pt-br\"> </a></span> is required to mine cinnabar.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pigment\">Pigment</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Pigment/pt-br\" title=\"Pigment/pt-br\">Pigmento</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pigment/pt-br\" title=\"Pigment/pt-br\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O cinábrio pode ser usado para <abbr title=\"Esgueirar-se, o padrão é shift e clicar com o botão direito\">escrever</abbr> em placas. Cinábrio triturado é usado para criar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">corante vermelho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dye\">Dye</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<dl><dd><i>See also: <a href=\"/Dye/pt-br\" title=\"Dye/pt-br\">Tingir</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye/pt-br\" title=\"Dye/pt-br\"> </a></span></i></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>O cinábrio deve primeiro ser <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical_Power#Crushing\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Mechanical Power\">pulverizado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Mechanical_Power#Crushing\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mechanical Power\"> </a></span> transformado em cinábrio triturado antes de poder ser usado para tingir.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>1 crushed cinnabar and 5 liters of water can be combined in a <a href=\"/Barrel/pt-br\" title=\"Barrel/pt-br\">barrel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Barrel/pt-br\" title=\"Barrel/pt-br\"> </a></span> and sealed for 8 hours to produce 5 liters of red dye, which can be used to create red <a href=\"/Cloth/pt-br\" title=\"Cloth/pt-br\">cloth</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Cloth/pt-br\" title=\"Cloth/pt-br\"> </a></span> and <a href=\"/Leather/pt-br\" title=\"Leather/pt-br\">leather</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Leather/pt-br\" title=\"Leather/pt-br\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling\">Selling</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<p>1 cinnabar can be sold to the <a href=\"/Villager#Tailor/pt-br\" title=\"Villager\">tailor</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Villager#Tailor/pt-br\" title=\"Villager\"> </a></span> for 2 to 4 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rusty_gear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rusty gear\">rusty gears</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rusty_gear\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rusty gear\"> </a></span>. This trade can be performed 3 to 5 times per reset.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n</div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r285111\">.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=col]{background-color:#5E462A;color:#EAD3B3;border:2px solid #382b1e;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history td{border:transparent}.mw-parser-output .history th[scope=row]{background-color:#D1B296;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n/**/+1) td{background-color:#CCBCAB}.mw-parser-output .history tr:nth-child(2n) td{background-color:#E0CFBB}</style>\n<strong class=\"error\"><span class=\"scribunto-error mw-scribunto-error-112edf4d\">Lua error in Module:History at line 30: attempt to index local &#39;version&#39; (a nil value).</span></strong><table class=\"wikitable history\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\">Versão\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Descrição\n</th></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<ul><li>While cinnabar deposits can generate loose stones on the surface, this is extremely rare, as the deposits tend to generate at a very low elevation.</li>\n<li>Crushed cinnabar can be ground into powdered cinnabar in a <a href=\"/Quern/pt-br\" title=\"Quern/pt-br\">quern</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Quern/pt-br\" title=\"Quern/pt-br\"> </a></span>. However, this item currently has no usage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n</div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Powder-cinnabar.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Powdered cinnabar\"><img alt=\"Powdered cinnabar\" src=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Powder-cinnabar.png/120px-Powder-cinnabar.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/2b/Powder-cinnabar.png/180px-Powder-cinnabar.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/2/2b/Powder-cinnabar.png/240px-Powder-cinnabar.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">Powdered cinnabar</span></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<div lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" class=\"mw-content-ltr\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); 